---
/**
 * Compact first-visit summary for the $99 booking boxes on /testing.
 * The full walkthrough lives at /first-visit. The booking button stays
 * outside this component and still goes straight to Neo.
 */
---

<aside class="first-visit-compact" aria-label="What happens at your first visit">
  <p class="first-visit-compact-title">What happens at your first visit</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Bring any labs you already have.</li>
    <li>Tell us your story: what's going on, what you've tried, what you've been told.</li>
    <li>We read your labs together and pick which one or two tests, if any, are worth running first.</li>
    <li>You leave with a clear starting point and every price up front.</li>
  </ol>
  <a class="first-visit-compact-link" href="/first-visit">See the full first visit walkthrough →</a>
</aside>

<style>
  .first-visit-compact {
    margin: 0 0 0.55rem;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .first-visit-compact-title {
    margin: 0 0 0.2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
    color: var(--color-ink-strong);
  }
  ol {
    margin: 0 0 0.28rem;
    padding: 0 0 0 1.05rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.28;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  li + li {
    margin-top: 0.08rem;
  }
  .first-visit-compact-link {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
</style>
